    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 371 of the laws of 2009 amending the public health law relating to the residential care off-site facility demonstration project, in relation to extending the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7062",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7062-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
